        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amaagacho abere arenge ase amakere ye Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria akang’ira ase eraaro ya isiko erochie sugusu, na akang’ira ase enyomba rirondo yanachanire ebinyomba yarenge gati y’aase atigire ataagachire na oboagacho bwa sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe bw’enyomba eria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko rigana erimo, na obogare bwaye amaboko emerongo etano, na egesoero nigo kiarochie sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa aase atigire ataagachire arenge nobogare bw’amaboko emerongo ebere gochia ase eraaro ya isiko yatichire namagena, ebitambokero mbiarengeo biare gotirimbokerwa gochia ase amarongo atato ay’enyomba eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bosio bw’ebinyomba biria aase arenge goeterwa narengeo; obogare bwaye nigo bwarenge obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko ikomi, na obotambe bwaye amaboko rigana erimo. Ebisieri bi’ebinyomba biria nigo biarochie sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba bia igoro nigo biarenge ebieng’e gochia ime kobua biria binde, ebia gati na ebia inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba ebio biaagachetwe ase rirongo ria gatato tibiabwate chisiiro buna chigoora. Ase ayio ebinyomba bia igoro nigo biarenge ebieng’e gochia ime kobua ebia inse na ebia gati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwaki ndwarenge mbarabare y’ebinyomba biria rwarochie gochia ase eraaro ya isiko. Obotambe bwaye nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe bw’ebinyomba biarochie ase eraaro ya isiko nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano, na obotambe bw’ebio biarenge ang’e ne Hekalu amaboko rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inse y’ebinyomba ebio, ensemo ya moocha egesoero nkiarengeo ase omonto aranyare gosoera korwa ase eraaro ya isiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba eria rirondo yanachanire ebinyomba yarenge ang’e norwaki oronetu rwarenge Irianyi, egati y’aase atigire ataagachire na oboagacho bwa Irianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bosio bw’ebinyomba ebio aase arenge goeterwa narengeo. Ebinyomba ebio nigo biareng’aine na biria biarenge ensemo ya sugusu. Obotambe bwabo na obogare nigo bwarenge buna obw’ebio. Aase abo onsi arenge goeterwa nigo areng’aine buna aase aria aande, na emeroberio ende yonsi amo nebisieri nigo biarenge buna emeroberio eria ende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisieri biabo nigo biarenge buna ebi’ebinyomba bia Irianyi. Egesieri nkiarenge ase omochakano bw’aase aria arenge goeterwa, engencho yaye aase arenge ensemo ya moocha ang’e norwaki ase omonto aranyare goetera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria aganteebia, “Ebinyomba ebio bire ensemo ya sugusu, na ebia Irianyi, kororia aase atigire ataagachiri, ebio nebichenu. Abakuani abwo bagotenena ase obosio bw’Omonene nao barabe bakoriera ebing’wanso bire ebichenu mono; agwo nao barabeeke ebing’wanso bire ebichenu mono: okoruegwa kw’endagera, na ebing’wanso bi’ebibe, na ebi’okomocha, ekiagera aase agwo naachenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abakuani barabe bagosoa Aase Aachenu tibagosoka korwa agwo gocha ase eraaro ya isiko bataruseti chianga chi’obokoreri bwabo, bachitige ase ebinyomba, ebio, ekiagera nebichenu bire. Goika babeeke chianga ching’ao ekero bagosoka gochia aase abanto bare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebirengo bi’aase e Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omonto oria konya akoorire korengia aase Hekalu a ime, agansokia isiko goetera ase egeita kiarenge ensemo ya moocha, erio akarengia aase onsi aetanaine Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaimokia emoti, akarengera ensemo ya moocha, ekaba chimoti amagana atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akaonchoka, akarengia ensemo ya sugusu, ekaba chimoti amagana atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarengia ensemo ya Irianyi, ekaba chimoti amagana atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akaonchoka gochia ensemo ya bosongo, akayerenga ekaba chimoti amagana atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo akarengia chinsemo chionsi inye chi’aase aria. Orwaki nigo rwaetanaineo; obotambe bwaye nigo bwarenge obwe chimoti amagana atano, na obogare bwaye boigo. Orwaki orwo nigo rwatananete aase aachenu korwa aase atari aachenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
